AltoBorrowMarket::RemoveSupply()
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── given invalid inputs
│   ├── when both assets and shares are zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when both assets and shares are non-zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when receiver is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when sender is not authorized for onBehalf
│       └── it should revert
└── given valid inputs
    ├── when assets is zero
    │   ├── it should calculate assets from shares
    │   └── it should remove supply shares from position
    ├── when shares is zero
    │   ├── it should calculate shares from assets
    │   └── it should remove supply shares from position
    ├── given totalBorrowed equals totalSupply
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── it should emit AccrueInterest
    ├── it should update totalSupply
    ├── it should not update totalBorrowed
    ├── it should transfer borrow tokens to receiver
    ├── it should emit RemoveSupply event
    ├── it should remove supply shares from position
    └── it should return the amount of assets and shares removed